# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
package-lock.json
dist
dist-ssr
dist-electron
release
build/*
# `build/native/` is deliberately *not* excepted, unlike the icons below.
#
# It holds compiled helpers, and every build already makes them: the release
# workflow runs `native/audio-capture/build.sh` on Linux and macOS and
# `native\build.bat` on Windows, each on its own runner, and both scripts
# `mkdir` this directory before writing into it. The committed copies were
# overwritten on every release and shipped inside every macOS build for no
# reason — a .dmg carried two Windows .exe files.
#
# The `beforeBuild` check needs the *directory* to exist, which the build
# scripts see to. It does not need it to be in git.
!build/icon.*
# Named rather than widening the glob to `icon*`: that would also re-include
# build/icon-sizes/, the intermediate PNGs the .ico is assembled from.
!build/icon-macos.png
!build/entitlements.mac.plist
!build/installer.nsh
# Generated by scripts/generate-tray-icon.mjs and committed on purpose.
# electron-builder copies these through extraResources, and a missing
# extraResource is skipped silently rather than failing the build — so leaving
# them ignored shipped a release with no menu bar icon at all.
!build/trayTemplate*.png
!build/tray-*.png
*.local

# MSVC intermediates, which were committed next to the sources they came from.
*.obj

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
.env

# 12MB of MediaPipe WASM, copied from node_modules by scripts/copy-mediapipe.mjs
public/mediapipe/

